摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"ASCetic — compact ASCII / terminal theme for DeepSeek Harness: 19 palettes, 3 densities, vim-style status line, ascii.rest art","id":"gh:1432726186","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-theme-ascetic","slug":"TABmk/dsh-theme-ascetic","topics":["ascii","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"ASCetic — compact ASCII / terminal theme for DeepSeek Harness: 19 palettes, 3 densities, vim-style s"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"tatus line, ascii.rest art"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"ASCetic"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A compact ASCII / terminal theme for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"ASCII + ascetic: nothing extra, everything drawn in characters."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Terminal look.** Monospace everywhere, square box-drawing chrome, hard drop shadows, Markdown th"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"at reads like source.\n- **19 palettes.** Retro monitors (`phosphor`, `amber`, `ice`, `mono`), `vapor"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"`, schemes after editor favourites, plus `auto` and `host`.\n- **3 densities.** `cozy`, `compact`, `d"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ense`: rows, spacing and type tighten together.\n- **Status line.** Agent state and turn timer, steps"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" and tok/s, a context meter, tokens and tool calls; click a segment for its details.\n- **ASCII art.*"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"* Hero scenes from ascii.rest on empty sessions, a framed New Session button, a retro boot intro wit"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"h your own logo text.\n- **Touch layout.** On a phone the status line becomes one thumb-sized row and"},{"id":"p6s8","text":" menus become bottom sheets."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"A session in tokyo-night"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"terminal chat style on amber, CRT scanlines on"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Palette picker with swatches, rose-pine"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Boot intro; the logo text is yours to change"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"On a phone"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"390px: one thumb row"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The menu as a bottom sheet"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Drawer with a scrim"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Desktop**"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Open **Plugins → Add plugin**, paste the address and press **Install**:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Web**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Then restart DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Update**"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Desktop: open **Plugins → dsh-theme-ascetic**, press **Uninstall** and add it again."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Web: run the command again. Your settings are kept."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Where | What |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `ASCII` in the status line | Quick menu: palette, density, chat style, hero art, logo text, toggle"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"s |\n| `pal` / `den` segments | Pickers; the palette list shows each palette's colours |\n| `⚙` in the"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" status line | The stock menu: Settings, Feedback, account |\n| Hero art on an empty session | Click "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"for the next art; `random` draws a new one per session |\n| Settings → General → ASCetic | Every opti"},{"id":"p27s5","text":" `random` draws a new one per session |\n| Settings → General → ASCetic | Every option in one place |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Tested on DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.3`."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Thanks to ascii.rest"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"All the ASCII art in ASCetic comes from **ascii.rest** by bas3line:\nthe hero scenes, the glinting bl"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ock-letter banner, the `chat` piece, and the `mount()` engine that draws\nthe New Session button and "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"the boot intro cell by cell. It is a lovely library, and this theme would be a\nlot plainer without i"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"o cell by cell. It is a lovely library, and this theme would be a\nlot plainer without it. Thank you!"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Palettes are inspired by Gruvbox, Nord, Dracula, Catppuccin, Tokyo Night, Rosé Pine, Everforest, Kan"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"agawa\nand Solarized; colours were adjusted where text needed more contrast."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
